    <item>
      <title>Thatsaid 1.5.31</title>
      <pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 19:14:55 GMT</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>10531</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.5.31</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<pre>Thatsaid 1.5.31
- Dictation: if macOS hasn&#x27;t granted Accessibility, the text goes to your clipboard (press ⌘V) and you get a notification. It no longer looks inserted when it wasn&#x27;t.
- Settings → Dictation tells you when macOS still holds an Accessibility grant from an older build, and how to fix it.
- Dictation is faster: the speech model stays loaded while dictation is on, so it no longer loads on your first hold.
- Settings: Updates now appears only under General (no duplicate under Mode).
</pre>]]></description>
